  "rationale": "Selecting a channel on the grid resets the Note Dashboard with -1 (channel_edit_page.lua:203-208). The Note and chord cells render -1 as X, but the Vel and Len cells were never given the X transform: line 196 passed note_displays.length to configure_mask_length_selector, which ignores its argument and re-configures the mask length selector. The dashboard read 'Vel -1' and 'Len -1.0'. The Vel and Len cells now get configure_note_page_velocity_length_value_selector; played values render unchanged.",
  "oracle": "README Note Dashboard 679: the first channel page shows the last played notes on the selected channel; no note has velocity or length -1. The absence marker X is the one the Note cell already shows (characterisation of the marker).",
